data: {"id":"chatcmpl-ecaeeae6-ffe7-4ed6-8022-f25e7898ee05","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795544954,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Now implementing the READ logic (R19d). Successfully implemented the READ record validation and action logic, including the view lookup and read mismatch checks based on the `f` flag. Completed the action execution for BEGIN, PUT/DELETE, and COMMIT records (R20, R21, and R22), focusing on transaction initialization, write list management, and conflict detection.\n\nCompleted conflict detection implementation (R22), focusing on ensuring no read/write conflicts arise with committed transactions. The final focus is replay logic (R23).\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

data: {"id":"chatcmpl-ecaeeae6-ffe7-4ed6-8022-f25e7898ee05","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795544954,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"R23, the replay logic, is now being implemented with a clear distinction between conflict and no-conflict scenarios. For conflict handling, it discards writes and flags the transaction as aborted. For no conflicts, it applies writes, updates the state, and records the committed transaction, including written keys in the `committedHistory`. After R23a, SAVEPOINT is implemented, storing the savepoint offset and position. Now going to double check it by reviewing the details.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

